{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "generated", "elements": [{"id": "k2YzONQiDA0hTHrKrg8z", "type": "frame", "x": 390, "y": 30, "width": 3563.5000000000005, "height": 1057, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#bbb", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0000", "roundness": null, "seed": 1241043596, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1957116585, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790800069251, "created": 1790800069251, "link": null, "locked": false, "name": "System diagram"}, {"id": "xok4JQIxTJWP0BjjSkOM", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": -40, "width": 980.1, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0001", "roundness": null, "seed": 255546888, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 514617484, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790800069251, "created": 1790800069251, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Telemetry system with inconsistent metric names (Anthropic SD Q5 \u00a710): the answer", "fontSize": 22, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Telemetry system with inconsistent metric names (Anthropic SD Q5 \u00a710): the answer", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "Wc10nTThPh4Q8dtMLl30", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": 20, "width": 716.1, "height": 175.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0002", "roundness": null, "seed": 1294573151, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1715636441, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790800069251, "created": 1790800069251, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Say it in five sentences first\n1 Clients batch events to an ingestion gateway that validates, stamps an event id,\n  appends to Kafka and acks only after the append: never blocked, nothing lost after the ack.\n2 Three consumers read the same log: a raw writer to cold storage, a stream processor\n  that canonicalises names and rolls up per series into 1-min buckets, an alert evaluator.\n3 Rollups land in a time-series store for dashboards; raw stays for replay.\n4 Names resolve at ingest through a versioned alias registry; raw name kept;\n  unknown names go to quarantine, never dropped, never guessed.\n5 History is fixed by replaying raw through the mapping; a query-time alias view\n  bridges the gap while the backfill runs.", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Say it in five sentences first\n1 Clients batch events to an ingestion gateway that validates, stamps an event id,\n  appends to Kafka and acks only after the append: never blocked, nothing lost after the ack.\n2 Three consumers read the same log: a raw writer to cold storage, a stream processor\n  that canonicalises names and rolls up per series into 1-min buckets, an alert evaluator.\n3 Rollups land in a time-series store for dashboards; raw stays for replay.\n4 Names resolve at ingest through a versioned alias registry; raw name kept;\n  unknown names go to quarantine, never dropped, never guessed.\n5 History is fixed by replaying raw through the mapping; a query-time alias view\n  bridges the gap while the backfill runs.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "jPzPEybiCTAUH2Otiec1", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": 219.0, "width": 662.2, "height": 122.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0003", "roundness": null, "seed": 469565579, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 548275386, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790800069251, "created": 1790800069251, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Requirements\nFR: clients send events continuously (batched) \u00b7 engineers query metrics by name\nand time \u00b7 alerts on key metrics \u00b7 processed metrics exposed to dashboards\nAsk: what is an event? who queries? freshness? retention raw vs rollups? cardinality?\nTechnical: 100k clients, 1M events/s \u00b7 ingest never blocks or rejects \u00b7 at-least-once,\ndedupe by event_id \u00b7 queryable < 60 s \u00b7 raw kept for replay \u00b7 availability over\nconsistency ('a deposit, not a withdrawal: a queue in front of the store')", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Requirements\nFR: clients send events continuously (batched) \u00b7 engineers query metrics by name\nand time \u00b7 alerts on key metrics \u00b7 processed metrics exposed to dashboards\nAsk: what is an event? who queries? freshness? retention raw vs rollups? cardinality?\nTechnical: 100k clients, 1M events/s \u00b7 ingest never blocks or rejects \u00b7 at-least-once,\ndedupe by event_id \u00b7 queryable < 60 s \u00b7 raw kept for replay \u00b7 availability over\nconsistency ('a deposit, not a withdrawal: a queue in front of the store')", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "3zSfGLg6nwCSWfPH5pxR", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": 365.5, "width": 608.3000000000001, "height": 87.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0004", "roundness": null, "seed": 1631282766, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1265907685, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790800069251, "created": 1790800069251, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Numbers\n1M/s \u00d7 200 B = 200 MB/s \u2248 17 TB/day raw \u00b7 week hot 120 TB \u00b7 year cold ~6 PB raw\nKafka ~10 MB/s per partition \u2192 20\u201330 for bandwidth, ~100 keyed by client_id\nRollups per series: 100k clients \u00d7 100 metrics = 10M series \u2192 10M rows/min\nFreshness: batch 1\u20135 s + Kafka + 60 s window \u2248 60 s", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Numbers\n1M/s \u00d7 200 B = 200 MB/s \u2248 17 TB/day raw \u00b7 week hot 120 TB \u00b7 year cold ~6 PB raw\nKafka ~10 MB/s per partition \u2192 20\u201330 for bandwidth, ~100 keyed by client_id\nRollups per series: 100k clients \u00d7 100 metrics = 10M series \u2192 10M rows/min\nFreshness: batch 1\u20135 s + Kafka + 60 s window \u2248 60 s", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "UTnkblPdoJjuoPh9LSIE", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": 477.0, "width": 716.1, "height": 70.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0005", "roundness": null, "seed": 1531535568, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1163889375, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790800069251, "created": 1790800069251, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Core entities (things you can count)\nEvent(event_id, client_id, name_raw, canonical_id, labels, value, ts, schema_v)\nSeries(canonical_id + labels)   Rollup(series, bucket, granularity, count/sum/min/max/p99)\nAlias(raw_name, canonical_id, valid_from, mapped_by)   AlertRule(selector, condition, window)", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Core entities (things you can count)\nEvent(event_id, client_id, name_raw, canonical_id, labels, value, ts, schema_v)\nSeries(canonical_id + labels)   Rollup(series, bucket, granularity, count/sum/min/max/p99)\nAlias(raw_name, canonical_id, valid_from, mapped_by)   AlertRule(selector, condition, window)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "YbK6NFOkTWeFKvQ54tj0", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": 571.0, "width": 662.2, "height": 87.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0006", "roundness": null, "seed": 990432530, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 528482168, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790800069251, "created": 1790800069251, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "API (CRUD each entity)\nPOST /events  [batch] -> 202 after the Kafka append; idempotent on event_id\nGET  /metrics?name&labels&from&to&step&agg  -> buckets (raw below the smallest rollup)\nPUT  /aliases {raw_name, canonical}   GET /aliases/unmapped (review queue)\nPOST /alerts   GET /alerts/{id}/state", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "API (CRUD each entity)\nPOST /events  [batch] -> 202 after the Kafka append; idempotent on event_id\nGET  /metrics?name&labels&from&to&step&agg  -> buckets (raw below the smallest rollup)\nPUT  /aliases {raw_name, canonical}   GET /aliases/unmapped (review queue)\nPOST /alerts   GET /alerts/{id}/state", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "1rKsXQoFKolDeE6ZdZSR", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": 682.5, "width": 639.1, "height": 105.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0007", "roundness": null, "seed": 115112714, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 839380278, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790800069251, "created": 1790800069251, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "What breaks first\n- ack before the Kafka append -> batching loses a window; ack after, client retries\n- normaliser scrubbed -> the follow-up has no home; keep it, explain it\n- rollup per event -> per series with a memory budget; some metrics never rolled up\n- unknown names dropped or fuzzy-matched -> quarantine + review, versioned mapping\n- retry described as availability -> availability is accepting the write now", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "What breaks first\n- ack before the Kafka append -> batching loses a window; ack after, client retries\n- normaliser scrubbed -> the follow-up has no home; keep it, explain it\n- rollup per event -> per series with a memory budget; some metrics never rolled up\n- unknown names dropped or fuzzy-matched -> quarantine + review, versioned mapping\n- retry described as availability -> availability is accepting the write now", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "zE4JAbkMybKxo0MIGpSc", "type": "rectangle", "x": 420, "y": 240, "width": 300, "height": 104, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#f3f4f6", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "k2YzONQiDA0hTHrKrg8z", "index": "a0008", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1405918665, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 791300670, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "EJSllEUX0BSgyeZ9PUxX"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "LS8FC1eBnLYAmh3K5qrl"}], "updated": 1790800069251, "created": 1790800069251, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "EJSllEUX0BSgyeZ9PUxX", "type": "text", "x": 430, "y": 265.75, "width": 280, "height": 52.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "k2YzONQiDA0hTHrKrg8z", "index": "a0009", "roundness": null, "seed": 365164893, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 308478564, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790800069251, "created": 1790800069251, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Clients (100k, mixed agent versions)\nbuffer + batch 1\u20135 s \u00b7 event_id\nold ones still say 'send'", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "zE4JAbkMybKxo0MIGpSc", "originalText": "Clients (100k, mixed agent versions)\nbuffer + batch 1\u20135 s \u00b7 event_id\nold ones still say 'send'", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "wv1kjf0t3tZm382Q347r", "type": "rectangle", "x": 940, "y": 240, "width": 300, "height": 120, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ffedd5", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "k2YzONQiDA0hTHrKrg8z", "index": "a0010", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1175723255, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1485498799, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "8U2VVzOPMRJk6XbrdZtr"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "LS8FC1eBnLYAmh3K5qrl"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "yS6e2fOdHoYbF7GBOXQz"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "Q1BhIvcgyci6Hlcru6l5"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "LPQZ1256kVS3wVaxopfF"}], "updated": 1790800069251, "created": 1790800069251, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "8U2VVzOPMRJk6XbrdZtr", "type": "text", "x": 950, "y": 265.0, "width": 280, "height": 70.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "k2YzONQiDA0hTHrKrg8z", "index": "a0011", "roundness": null, "seed": 1255248342, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1162200688, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790800069251, "created": 1790800069251, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Ingestion gateway (= batching)\nvalidate \u00b7 dedupe on event_id\nalias lookup \u2192 canonical_id + version\nack only after the Kafka append", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "wv1kjf0t3tZm382Q347r", "originalText": "Ingestion gateway (= batching)\nvalidate \u00b7 dedupe on event_id\nalias lookup \u2192 canonical_id + version\nack only after the Kafka append", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "reqJj2HSx6xWLPAnZdLb", "type": "rectangle", "x": 940, "y": 60, "width": 300, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#dcfce7", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "k2YzONQiDA0hTHrKrg8z", "index": "a0012", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 2126506615, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1808475005, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "QFIDXc0hzOIT22fURZ8f"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "Q1BhIvcgyci6Hlcru6l5"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "vAeKKmzBKcd1ljQKx9sT"}], "updated": 1790800069251, "created": 1790800069251, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "QFIDXc0hzOIT22fURZ8f", "type": "text", "x": 950, "y": 75.75, "width": 280, "height": 52.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "k2YzONQiDA0hTHrKrg8z", "index": "a0013", "roundness": null, "seed": 1178237479, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1941886151, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790800069251, "created": 1790800069251, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Alias registry (versioned)\nsend \u2192 send_content \u00b7 gpu_one \u2192 gpu_two\nunknown \u2192 quarantine, human maps", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "reqJj2HSx6xWLPAnZdLb", "originalText": "Alias registry (versioned)\nsend \u2192 send_content \u00b7 gpu_one \u2192 gpu_two\nunknown \u2192 quarantine, human maps", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "8y3jXN5YW6zvmTKf0RjQ", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1460, "y": 240, "width": 300, "height": 104, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ede9fe", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "k2YzONQiDA0hTHrKrg8z", "index": "a0014", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 887549314, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 790798554, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "6NXETpnbPf36up2hpkKW"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "yS6e2fOdHoYbF7GBOXQz"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "YRnEzxonMdAECQXHkk5C"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "pcWglAYeUszB99qLuuZN"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "cM8zN0YdEyi3YYGVFUzZ"}], "updated": 1790800069251, "created": 1790800069251, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "6NXETpnbPf36up2hpkKW", "type": "text", "x": 1470, "y": 265.75, "width": 280, "height": 52.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "k2YzONQiDA0hTHrKrg8z", "index": "a0015", "roundness": null, "seed": 348485470, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 352045037, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790800069251, "created": 1790800069251, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Kafka (durable append-only log)\n~100 partitions by client_id\nfan-in before, fan-out after", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "8y3jXN5YW6zvmTKf0RjQ", "originalText": "Kafka (durable append-only log)\n~100 partitions by client_id\nfan-in before, fan-out after", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25