 "groupIds": [], "frameId": "k2YzONQiDA0hTHrKrg8z", "index": "a0060", "roundness": null, "seed": 1850110393, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 508866365, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790800069251, "created": 1790800069251, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "rewrite rollups", "fontSize": 13, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "rewrite rollups", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "RTYao4Xf3UyyvYqALFFi", "type": "text", "x": 420, "y": 840, "width": 3503.5000000000005, "height": 17.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#b91c1c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "k2YzONQiDA0hTHrKrg8z", "index": "a0061", "roundness": null, "seed": 357838375, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1191701332, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790800069251, "created": 1790800069251, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Follow-up, two parts (Tyler's split). 1 Stop new data landing under old names: resolve at ingest through the versioned alias registry, keep the raw name on the record, quarantine unknowns. 2 Fix the history: replay raw from the lake through mapping vN into canonical partitions, rewrite the rollups, measure coverage and collisions; meanwhile the metrics API expands send_content = send \u222a send_content at query time so the user sees one series and no gap.", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Follow-up, two parts (Tyler's split). 1 Stop new data landing under old names: resolve at ingest through the versioned alias registry, keep the raw name on the record, quarantine unknowns. 2 Fix the history: replay raw from the lake through mapping vN into canonical partitions, rewrite the rollups, measure coverage and collisions; meanwhile the metrics API expands send_content = send \u222a send_content at query time so the user sees one series and no gap.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "OPUILC2UOYYabVkq6tdt", "type": "text", "x": 420, "y": 910, "width": 1717.1000000000001, "height": 17.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "k2YzONQiDA0hTHrKrg8z", "index": "a0062", "roundness": null, "seed": 414090782, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 680165841, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790800069251, "created": 1790800069251, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Numbers to say: 1M/s \u00d7 200 B = 200 MB/s \u2248 17 TB/day \u00b7 10M series \u2192 rollups per series, not per event \u00b7 20\u2013100 Kafka partitions \u00b7 60 s freshness budget \u00b7 shed by tier (debug first, never errors) rather than block the client.", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Numbers to say: 1M/s \u00d7 200 B = 200 MB/s \u2248 17 TB/day \u00b7 10M series \u2192 rollups per series, not per event \u00b7 20\u2013100 Kafka partitions \u00b7 60 s freshness budget \u00b7 shed by tier (debug first, never errors) rather than block the client.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "cgt5uEWuJjAJN4tRMCjW", "type": "text", "x": 420, "y": 955, "width": 1909.6000000000001, "height": 17.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "k2YzONQiDA0hTHrKrg8z", "index": "a0063", "roundness": null, "seed": 347748484, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1811911760, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790800069251, "created": 1790800069251, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Tyler's lines: 'if you need a queue, you are available over consistent' \u00b7 entities are things you can count; CRUD each one and the yeses are the API \u00b7 batching is a failure window: ack after the append \u00b7 roll up per event type with a memory budget.", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Tyler's lines: 'if you need a queue, you are available over consistent' \u00b7 entities are things you can count; CRUD each one and the yeses are the API \u00b7 batching is a failure window: ack after the append \u00b7 roll up per event type with a memory budget.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "w5ubfPPNZ00UsCPCfvys", "type": "text", "x": 420, "y": 1005, "width": 52.800000000000004, "height": 20.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "k2YzONQiDA0hTHrKrg8z", "index": "a0064", "roundness": null, "seed": 306955539, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1027729498, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790800069251, "created": 1790800069251, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Legend", "fontSize": 16, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Legend", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "Qt6FY2RvfwjUWSsziFhz", "type": "rectangle", "x": 420, "y": 1035, "width": 22, "height": 22, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#f3f4f6", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "k2YzONQiDA0hTHrKrg8z", "index": "a0065", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1934059590, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1733212890, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790800069251, "created": 1790800069251, "link": null, "l